N64DoomPort
===========

This project as a whole is licensed under GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE), because it is
compiled and linked with GPL-3.0 code.

Third-party components
----------------------

* DoomRPG-RE  (core/src/doomrpg/)
    Erick194/DoomRPG-RE, upstream commit 8ff35da.  GPL-3.0.
    Reverse-engineered engine for Doom RPG.  Vendored unmodified except that
    Main.c and SDL_Video.c are omitted (replaced by core/src/port/).

* BarToZip.exe, zlib.dll  (core/tools/bartozip/)
    From the DoomRPG-RE v0.2.1+ release.  GPL-3.0 (with DoomRPG-RE).
    Decodes the BREW .bar, including the PMD sound resources.

* libdragon  (core/libdragon/, git submodule)
    DragonMinded/libdragon.  The Unlicense (public domain).
    N64 SDK: display / mixer / wav64 / DragonFS and the host tools
    (mkdfs, n64tool, audioconv64, n64elfcompress, ed64romconfig).

* miniz  (core/src/doomrpg/miniz.h)
    Rich Geldreich et al.  MIT / public domain.  Raw inflate for Z_Zip.c.

Not included
------------

Doom RPG is (c) id Software / Electronic Arts / JAMDAT.  No Doom RPG assets,
maps, text, audio or soundtrack are distributed here.  Building a playable ROM
requires a doomrpg.zip that you obtained legally.

SoundFonts (core/tools/soundfont/) are third-party and are not redistributed.
